<%- include('header') %><section class="panel"><h1>Facilitator login</h1><p><%= f.full_name %> · <%= f.number %></p><p><a href="/facilitators/<%= f.id %>/">Back to facilitator</a></p><% if(error){ %><p class="alert alert-danger" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %><p>Facilitators can view only their own details and current ID card. The temporary password must be changed at first sign-in. No staff role is assigned.</p><% if(account){ %><p>Username: <strong><%= account.username %></strong> · <%= account.active?'Active':'Inactive — reactivate in Administration → Accounts before resetting' %></p><% } %><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= f.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="<%= account?'reset':'create' %>"><% if(account){ %><input type="hidden" name="account_revision" value="<%= account.revision %>"><% }else{ %><label>Username *<input class="form-control mb-3" name="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="150" pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9_.-]{3,150}" value="<%= f.number.toLowerCase() %>" autocomplete="off"></label><label>Account email (optional)<input class="form-control mb-3" type="email" name="email" maxlength="254" value="<%= email %>"></label><% } %><p>Leave both password fields blank to generate a secure temporary password. It is shown once after saving.</p><label>Temporary password<input class="form-control mb-3" name="password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="256" autocomplete="new-password"></label><label>Confirm temporary password<input class="form-control mb-3" name="confirm_password" type="password" maxlength="256" autocomplete="new-password"></label><label>Reason *<textarea class="form-control mb-3" name="reason" required maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><button class="btn btn-primary" <%= account&&!account.active?'disabled':'' %>><%= account?'Reset temporary password':'Allocate login' %></button></form></section><%- include('footer') %>